  "2026-11-05T11:10:00.550Z",codex-agent,"Cutoff receipt for source 48abcd82b0c0e18e2b2409a631030e984d445af8: complete bun run release:check PASSED on Node 26 at 11:07:47 UTC, job https://github.com/unbraind/pm-github/actions/runs/42012432073/job/127194531337 . Downloaded completed-job logs verify 1754 tests: 1752 passed, zero failed/cancelled, two pre-existing SDK 2026.11.4 lifecycle-compensation quarantines for pm-cli#1656. Full inventory: 30 authored modules at exact 100/100/100/100 coverage, zero production audit vulnerabilities and all remaining release steps passed. At the 30-minute observation cutoff, full npm gates on Node 22/26 and Bun on Node 22 were still running: https://github.com/unbraind/pm-github/actions/runs/42012432073 . Those three are pending, not passing evidence; no further CI polling. CodeQL and Semgrep passed. Local Node 26 full npm attempt passed prechecks and privacy, then progressed without reported failures through real closeout fixtures, including the previously problematic first scenario after fresh npm ci. Stopped its owned process tree at handoff; this unfinished attempt is not a pass. No local test/watch process remains. Separate production audit, package dry run/build, changelog check and publication attestation passed. No dependency, threshold or quarantine changes were made."
